### Protected admin route without token — expected 401
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/ping

### Protected admin route with seller token — expected 403
# Execute seller login first and replace the value below.
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer <seller-token>

### Protected admin route with admin token — expected 200
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer <admin-token>
